 "system": "adaptintake",
 "transcript": [
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Hello, I'm here to help you get ready for your appointment. Could you tell me what has been bothering you?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "My right knee's been getting worse."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Could you tell me when your knee problem first started, how it came on, and whether you have any allergies or bad reactions to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "It's ached on and off for about three years."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Could you tell me how your knee is doing these days and what medicines you take regularly or have taken recently, including doses if you know them?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Six years ago I had a stent put in my heart."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Have you ever had an allergy or a bad reaction to any medicine — yes, no, or you're not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Penicillin gives me a rash."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thinking about your right knee these days, would you say it bothers you mildly, moderately, or severely — or you're not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "About 7 out of 10 on bad days."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Could you tell me about any medicines you take regularly or have taken recently, including any new or changed ones, and the doses if you know them?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I take metformin, one gram twice a day."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Along with your knee problem, have you noticed any other symptoms?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "My grandson's just started university, you know."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Does anything make your knee feel better or worse?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Worse going down the stairs."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Have you noticed any other symptoms along with your knee problem—yes, a few; no, none at all; or you're not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "It sometimes swells a bit by evening."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Besides the heart stent you mentioned, is there anything else about your past health, operations, or hospital stays that you’d like to add?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I've had type 2 diabetes about ten years."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "What worries you most about your right knee?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I want something stronger for the pain."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Besides your heart stent and diabetes, is there anything else from your past health you’d like to add?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Nothing else I can think of."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How does your right knee problem affect what you’re able to do during a typical day?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Can't walk the dog round the park anymore."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Besides the metformin 1 gram twice a day, are there any other medicines you take regularly, or any new or changed ones?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I take aspirin 75 milligrams once a day."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Besides the swelling that sometimes comes on by the evening, is there anything else you’d like to add about your knee?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Knee feels stiff about twenty minutes in the morning."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, that is very helpful. I have put together a short summary of what you told me. Please read it and tell me if anything should be corrected before it goes to your doctor."
  }
 ],
